1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:01,700
Monsieur LaPadite

2
00:00:03,367 --> 00:00:08,133
I regret to inform you I've exhausted the extent of my French.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:13,167
To continue to speak it so inadequately would only serve to embarrass me.

4
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:17,267
However, I've been led to believe you speak English quite well.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,633
Yes.

6
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:23,900
Well, it just so happens, I do as well. This being your house

7
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:26,600
I ask your permission to switch to English

8
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:28,433
for the remainder of the conversation.

9
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:33,000
But the meaning of your visit,

10
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:37,667
pleasant though it is, is mysterious to me.

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,600
The Germans looked through my house nine months ago for hiding Jews

12
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:44,300
and found nothing.

13
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,767
I'm aware of that.

14
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:50,733
I've read the reports of this area.

15
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:55,967
But like any enterprise, when under new management,

16
00:00:56,067 --> 00:00:59,133
there is always a slight duplication of efforts,

17
00:01:00,367 --> 00:01:05,033
most of it being a complete waste of time, but needs to be done nevertheless.

18
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:09,100
I just have a few questions, monsieur LaPadite.

19
00:01:10,567 --> 00:01:12,867
If you can assist me with answers,

20
00:01:12,967 --> 00:01:16,033
my department can close the file on your family.

21
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:19,833
According to these papers,

22
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:24,633
all the Jewish families in this area
have been accounted for,

23
00:01:24,733 --> 00:01:27,267
except the Dreyfuses.

24
00:01:27,867 --> 00:01:32,967
What rumors have you heard
about the Dreyfuses?

25
00:01:33,833 --> 00:01:37,233
Again, this is only a rumor,

26
00:01:37,233 --> 00:01:44,100
but we heard they had made
their way into Spain.

27
00:01:44,633 --> 00:01:48,433
Having never met the Dreyfuses, would you confirm for me

28
00:01:48,533 --> 00:01:51,767
the exact members of the household and their names?

29
00:01:57,233 --> 00:01:59,200
There were five of them.

30
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:04,067
The father, Jacob.

31
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:08,433
Wife, Miriam.

32
00:02:10,467 --> 00:02:14,100
And her brother, Bob.

33
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:18,900
And the children,

34
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,200
Amos and Shosanna.

35
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:27,000
And Shosanna?

36
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,500
Shosanna was 18 or 19.
I’m not really sure.

37
00:02:37,633 --> 00:02:38,800
Monsieur LaPadite,

38
00:02:38,833 --> 00:02:43,433
are you aware of the nickname the people of France have given me?

39
00:02:47,133 --> 00:02:49,933
I have no interest in such things.

40
00:02:51,133 --> 00:02:53,233
But you are aware of what they call me.

41
00:02:56,300 --> 00:02:57,367
I'm aware.

42
00:02:59,233 --> 00:03:01,133
What are you aware of?

43
00:03:11,133 --> 00:03:12,933
That they call you "The Jew Hunter."

44
00:03:13,167 --> 00:03:13,967
Precisely.

45
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:19,733
The feature that makes me such an effective hunter of the Jews is,

46
00:03:19,867 --> 00:03:22,500
as opposed to most German soldiers,

47
00:03:22,567 --> 00:03:24,567
I can think like a Jew

48
00:03:25,233 --> 00:03:28,000
where they can only think like a German.

49
00:03:28,367 --> 00:03:31,067
More precisely, a German soldier.

50
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:42,367
Now, if one were to determine what attribute the German people share with a beast,

51
00:03:42,933 --> 00:03:46,500
it would be the cunning and the predatory instinct of a hawk.

52
00:03:46,933 --> 00:03:50,800
But if one were to determine what attributes the Jews share with a beast,

53
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:53,033
it would be that of the rat.

54
00:03:55,767 --> 00:03:59,633
The Führer and Goebbels' propaganda have said pretty much the same thing.

55
00:03:59,733 --> 00:04:02,733
But where our conclusions differ,

56
00:04:02,867 --> 00:04:05,867
is I don't consider the comparison an insult.

57
00:04:08,367 --> 00:04:12,200
Consider for a moment the world a rat lives in.

58
00:04:13,067 --> 00:04:15,233
It's a hostile world, indeed.

59
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:19,500
If a rat were to scamper through your front door, right now,

60
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,033
would you greet it with hostility?

61
00:04:22,967 --> 00:04:24,833
I suppose I would.

62
00:04:24,933 --> 00:04:29,833
Has a rat ever done anything to you to create this animosity you feel toward them?

63
00:04:30,767 --> 00:04:33,367
Rats spread disease. They bite people.

64
00:04:33,933 --> 00:04:37,700
Rats were the cause of the bubonic plague, but that's some time ago.

65
00:04:37,767 --> 00:04:40,400
I propose to you any disease a rat could spread,

66
00:04:40,467 --> 00:04:42,933
a squirrel could equally carry.

67
00:04:43,033 --> 00:04:44,667
Would you agree?

68
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:49,067
Yet, I assume you don't share the same animosity with squirrels

69
00:04:49,167 --> 00:04:51,967
- that you do with rats, do you? - No.

70
00:04:52,367 --> 00:04:54,867
Yet, they're both rodents, are they not?

71
00:04:54,967 --> 00:04:58,967
And except for the tail, they even rather look alike, don't they?

72
00:04:59,333 --> 00:05:02,167
It's an interesting thought, Herr Colonel.

73
00:05:02,867 --> 00:05:04,933
However interesting as the thought may be,

74
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:08,300
it makes not one bit of difference to how you feel.

75
00:05:10,633 --> 00:05:14,667
If a rat were to walk in here, right now, as I'm talking

76
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:19,700
would you greet it with a saucer of your delicious milk?

77
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,233
Probably not.

78
00:05:21,900 --> 00:05:23,567
I didn't think so.

79
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:25,733
You don't like them.

80
00:05:25,833 --> 00:05:27,733
You don't really know why you don't like them.

81
00:05:27,833 --> 00:05:30,533
All you know is you find them repulsive.

82
00:05:32,733 --> 00:05:35,833
Consequently, a German soldier conducts a search

83
00:05:35,900 --> 00:05:38,400
of a house suspected of hiding Jews.

84
00:05:39,333 --> 00:05:40,933
Where does the hawk look?

85
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,200
He looks in the barn, he looks in the attic, he looks in the cellar,

86
00:05:44,333 --> 00:05:46,700
he looks everywhere he would hide.

87
00:05:47,667 --> 00:05:51,833
But there are so many places it would never occur to a hawk to hide.

88
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:57,767
However, the reason the Führer has brought me off my Alps in Austria

89
00:05:57,867 --> 00:06:02,267
and placed me in French cow country today is because it does occur to me.

90
00:06:03,533 --> 00:06:06,900
Because I'm aware what tremendous feats human beings are capable of

91
00:06:07,033 --> 00:06:09,000
once they abandon dignity.

92
00:06:09,433 --> 00:06:13,367
And if there are any irregularities to be found, rest assured they will be.

93
00:06:13,433 --> 00:06:15,667
That is unless you have something to tell me

94
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,967
that makes the conducting of a search unnecessary.

95
00:06:18,533 --> 00:06:20,767
I might add, also, that any information

96
00:06:20,867 --> 00:06:25,533
that makes the performance of my duty easier will not be met with punishment.

97
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:30,167
Actually, quite the contrary. It will be met with reward.

98
00:06:30,567 --> 00:06:33,867
You're sheltering enemies of the state, are you not?

99
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,267
Yes.

100
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:42,100
You're sheltering them underneath your floorboards, aren't you?

101
00:06:44,667 --> 00:06:45,733
Yes.

102
00:06:48,533 --> 00:06:51,567
Point out to me the areas where they're hiding.

103
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,367
Since I haven't heard any disturbance,

104
00:06:54,433 --> 00:06:58,167
I assume, while they're listening, they don't speak English.

105
00:07:00,067 --> 00:07:01,167
Yes.

106
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:06,033
I'm going to switch back to French now, and I want you to follow my masquerade.

107
00:07:06,133 --> 00:07:07,633
Is that clear?

108
00:07:09,533 --> 00:07:10,433
Yes.

